    NYX @ sad "それに…壁を補強するには、{i}どうしても{/i}追加の人手が必要なんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:400
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_2a4adb84:

    # MC @ angry "So what, we're just leaving them as glorified bait?!"
    MC @ angry "だから何だ、あのまま格好いい囮にしておくのかえ？!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:401
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_420cf209:

    # MC @ angry "If the walls fall—where do they run?!"
    MC @ angry "壁が崩れ落ちたら―彼らはどこへ逃げる？!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:403
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_9eaae3f8:

    # "Nyx's fist slammed onto the desk, sending loose papers scattering. Half-finished defense plans and supply reports lay sprawled beneath her hands."
    "ニクスの拳が机をバシンと叩き、紙束が散らばった。未完成の防衛計画書や物資報告書が、彼女の手の下に机の上に散らばっている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:404
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_059aae2c:

    # NYX @ think "This city is the best-defended place in Alderay."
    NYX @ think "この都市は、アルデレイで最も防衛が堅い場所だ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:405
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_a65a9483:

    # NYX @ think "If we can't hold the line here—nowhere else will."
    NYX @ think "ここで防げなければ、もうどこでも防げない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:411
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_96237a66:

    # NYX @ think "What exactly are you saying?"
    NYX @ think "一体何を言っているの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:412
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_53a9f6ba:

    # MC @ talk "A girl... A scout who died during my expedition appeared to me."
    MC @ talk "少女... 私の遠征中に命を落とした、あの偵察兵の少女が現れた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:413
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_d80bb980:

    # NYX @ shock "...A dead girl spoke to you?"
    NYX @ shock "…死んだ少女が、あなたに話しかけた？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:415
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_1627a674:

    # NYX @ think "Have you lost your mind?"
    NYX @ think "正気ですか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:416
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_40b5b5b0:

    # MC @ angry "I know how it sounds, damn it!"
    MC @ angry "どう聞こえるか分かってる、ちくしょう!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:417
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_8a7c664a:

    # MC @ angry "She came bearing a warning—the Demorai are moving unseen pieces into place!"
    MC @ angry "彼女は警告をもたらした――デモライ族が、見えざる駒を動かし始めている!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:418
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_418422d2:

    # MC @ angry "This siege isn't what it seems!"
    MC @ angry "この包囲、そう単純じゃない!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:419
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_ccbb1ec1:

    # MC @ angry "They're making it look like it's just going to be a frontal assault but there's more to it!"
    MC @ angry "正面攻撃だけに見せかけてるけど、それだけじゃないんだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:420
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_14351e67:

    # MC @ angry "I KNOW it!"
    MC @ angry "わかってるよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:421
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_8e3b4384:

    # NYX @ angry "{i}Do you have any proof?{/i}"
    NYX @ angry "{i}何か証拠はありますか？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:422
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_72211272:

    # MC @ think "Not yet."
    MC @ think "まだだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:423
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_14333477:

    # NYX @ think "Then find some."
    NYX @ think "なら探してきて。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:424
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_710fcc10:

    # NYX @ think "If what you say is true, I need evidence before I can act."
    NYX @ think "君の言うことが本当なら、動く前に証拠が必要だ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:425
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_8dea862b:

    # MC "(Shit.)"
    MC "(くそ。)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:426
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_dfe5048c:

    # NYX @ talk "But while you're here... I need you to look into something for me."
    NYX @ talk "ちょうどいいところに…ちょっと調べてほしいことがあるんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:427
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_575b9967:

    # NYX @ talk "A group of my men, led by Sergeant Poltrik, vanished after investigating some traders who entered the city not long ago."
    NYX @ talk "私の部下の一隊が、先日この街に進入した商人を調査した後、ポルトリック軍曹に率いられたまま行方不明になった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:428
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_badcbe71:

    # NYX @ think "We haven't heard from them in {i}over a month.{/i}"
    NYX @ think "{i}一ヶ月以上も{/i}連絡がない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:429
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_a81295a7:

    # MC @ serious "And you think they were targeted?"
    MC @ serious "そして彼らが狙われたと思う？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:430
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_b24c5938:

    # NYX @ think "I {i}know{/i} they were."
    NYX @ think "確かに{i}そう{/i}だったわよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:431
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_0318de6f:

    # NYX @ think "Poltrik was thorough—he wouldn't just disappear."
    NYX @ think "ポルトリックは徹底的な男だ――単に消えてなくなるだけなんてことはしない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:432
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu_64ea4a92:

    # NYX @ talk "His last report said the traders' paperwork was a forgery. But before he could follow up, he and his men were gone."
    NYX @ talk "彼の最後の報告によれば、商人たちの書類は偽物だった。だが、追跡調査に入る前に、彼と部下たちは姿を消した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:435
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_25547c3f:

    # NYX @ think "There have been strange reports about these traders."
    NYX @ think "これらの商人について奇妙な報告が上がっている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:436
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_0ffccb19:

    # NYX @ think "Apparently, the food they brought with them was already rotting."
    NYX @ think "彼らが持ち込んだ食料は、すでに腐りかけていたようだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:437
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_2723daa6:

    # NYX @ talk "They were let in because their paperwork checked out, but an officer flagged it as suspicious."
    NYX @ talk "書類に問題がなかったため彼らは入れられたが、警官がそれを不審とマークした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:438
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_71e6f91f:

    # NYX @ think "When I looked closer, I realized the paperwork was a forgery."
    NYX @ think "よく見ると、書類は偽造だと気づいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:439
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_f0bc0383:

    # NYX @ think "I sent my men, including Sergeant Poltrik, to track the traders, but none of them returned."
    NYX @ think "私の部下たち、ポルトリック軍曹を含めて商人たちを追跡させたが、誰一人として戻ってこなかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:443
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_9f812a8b:

    # NYX @ shock "That depends... Is the risk of a plague spreading through Novaras {i}during a siege{/i} worth ignoring?"
    NYX @ shock "それは…包囲中のノヴァラスで疫病が蔓延するリスクを{i}見逃す価値があるか{/i}によりますね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:444
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_8e053423:

    # NYX @ shock "Or what if it's not disease, but explosives? Or something worse?"
    NYX @ shock "それとも、病気じゃなくて爆発物か何か？　それとももっと悪いもの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:445
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_2357fc10:

    # NYX @ angry "Even if it's just smuggled contraband, I can't let gangs use this crisis to their advantage."
    NYX @ angry "たとえ密輸品であれ、ギャングにこの危機を利用させるわけにはいかない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:449
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_5459bbf0:

    # NYX @ sad "{i}*Sigh*{/i} Without proof, I can't pull guards from the wall."
    NYX @ sad "{i}はあ…{/i} 証拠がなければ、壁から守衛を引き離せない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:450
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_8f3ff736:

    # NYX @ sad "Let's pray your {i}'source'{/i} is wrong."
    NYX @ sad "あなたの{i}情報{/i}が間違っていることを祈りましょう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:451
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_55d14314:

    # MC @ talk "Where were your men last seen?"
    MC @ talk "あなたの部下は最後にどこで目撃されましたか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:452
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_069b1991:

    # NYX @ talk "Sergeant Poltrik and his men were last seen questioning the gate guards."
    NYX @ talk "ポルトリック軍曹とその部下が最後に目撃されたのは、門番に尋問しているところをだった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:453
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_5aeb82a7:

    # NYX @ think "I'd start there if I were you."
    NYX @ think "私があなたなら、そこから始めるね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:461
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_68dfb6cd:

    # GUARD "Ahh... Yes."
    GUARD "ああ… うん。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:462
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_c3a8ad4c:

    # GUARD "We told the sergeant all we could about those strange traders."
    GUARD "あの妙な商人たちについて、私たちは軍曹にできる限りのことを話した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:463
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_44c733cc:

    # GUARD "What do you want to know?"
    GUARD "知りたいことは？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:467
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu1_24feb35d:

    # GUARD "They were... strange."
    GUARD "彼らは... 奇妙だった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:468
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu1_73831362:

    # GUARD "Pale as ghosts, and reeked of something foul."
    GUARD "幽霊のように白く、不気味な臭いがしていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:469
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu1_eabeb70b:

    # GUARD "Said they had come down from Angmurus, talking about a bad season and needing to restock before restarting their trade."
    GUARD "アングムルスから来たと言い、不作の季節を嘆き、交易を再開する前に補充が必要だと話していました。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:470
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu1_3a68a411:

    # GUARD "We almost didn't let them in."
    GUARD "危うく彼らを中に入れるところだった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:471
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu1_d23bdcc7:

    # GUARD "But with all the paperwork in order… what were we supposed to do?"
    GUARD "書類の手続きがすべて終わって…さて、どうしたものか"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:472
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu1_db79adb4:

    # GUARD "Our kingdoms may be divided, but free trade is still honored."
    GUARD "我が国々は分断されていようとも、自由貿易はなお尊重される。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:475
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_05e0f9f0:

    # GUARD "Of course not!"
    GUARD "とんでもない!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:476
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_4e3036d0:

    # GUARD "If we had, we'd have told them to sling their hook!"
    GUARD "もしそんなものがあれば、失せろって言ってやるよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:477
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_9eeb4641:

    # GUARD "The paperwork was flawless—even had the correct wax seal."
    GUARD "書類は完璧だった——封蝋の印も正しかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:481
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_46cf89a1:

    # GUARD "Like they hadn't washed in months."
    GUARD "まるで何ヶ月も洗っていないかのようだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:482
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_77abbcc7:

    # GUARD "For a moment, I thought they were undead…"
    GUARD "一瞬、アンデッドかと思った…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:483
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_273da914:

    # GUARD "But no, they were alive alright."
    GUARD "だがまさか、奴らはしっかり生きていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:484
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_20d4a46d:

    # GUARD "Figured they were just deep Northerners. I hear people in Angmurus can go months without washing."
    GUARD "ただの極北人かと思ったら。アングムルスでは数ヶ月も風呂に入らない人々がいるらしいね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:488
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_830a7f6d:

    # GUARD "Ask away then..."
    GUARD "じゃあ、聞いてくれ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:492
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_a01b11d8:

    # GUARD "Food, mostly. But a lot of it was already rotting."
    GUARD "ほとんどが食べ物だ。でもそのほとんどがもう腐っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:493
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_49d6742e:

    # GUARD "They claimed it was a bad season and wanted to restock in Novaras before heading back out."
    GUARD "彼らは悪い時期だと言い、再び出港する前にノヴァラスで仕入れ直したいと主張した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:494
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_8cb7282b:

    # GUARD "Strange, but at the time, it didn't seem worth turning them away."
    GUARD "奇妙なことだが、その時は彼らを追い返す価値もないと思えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:497
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_7af57f03:

    # GUARD "They had personal blades… but that's nothing unusual."
    GUARD "彼らは個人用ブレードを持っていた…けど、それは別に珍しいことじゃない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:498
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_a31d0a72:

    # GUARD "No weapons in their cargo."
    GUARD "積荷に武器はない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:502
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_da3c2429:

    # GUARD "None that I saw."
    GUARD "見た限りでは無いです。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:506
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_d26a5898:

    # GUARD "They wanted to use it for compost, said they might be able to make some money back that way."
    GUARD "堆肥に使いたい、そうすれば多少は費用を回収できるかもしれないと言っていました。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:507
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_7384b803:

    # GUARD "Seemed reasonable enough at the time."
    GUARD "あの時はそれが妥当だと思った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:511
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_830a7f6d:

    # GUARD "Ask away then..."
    GUARD "それでは質問をどうぞ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:515
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_998a7cf7:

    # GUARD "Last I heard, Sergeant Poltrik and his team were heading toward {i}The Iron Unicorn.{/i}"
