    "案の定、鍵がかかっていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1488
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_05534a52:

    # "With a sharp, hard boot, the door slammed open, the hinges groaning in protest."
    "鋭く硬い一蹴りで、ドアがぶち破られた。蝶番が軋み、抗議するように。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1489
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_3d637ddb:

    # MARKUS @ talk "Well... That's one way to announce our arrival."
    MARKUS @ talk "まあ…我々の到着アピールもこんなものかね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1490
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_4becea67:

    # MC @ think "Did you have a better idea?"
    MC @ think "もっといい考えはありましたか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1491
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_b61b131f:

    # MARKUS @ talk "Sure. We torch the place from the outside and then head to the Iron—"
    MARKUS @ talk "わかった。外から燃やし尽くして、それからアイアンへ向かう――"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1496
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_55ac44c5:

    # "Taking one of the hair pins, I knelt down and fiddled with the lock for a while."
    "髪留めを一つ手に取ると、私はしゃがみ込み、しばらく錠をいじくっていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1497
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_e57905ec:

    # "Markus raised a brow as he watched me work, no doubt curious as to where I learned such a trick."
    "マルクスは私の作業を見つめつつ、眉を上げた。そんな技をどこで覚えたのか、訝しんでいたに違いない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1498
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_1a1cfcb9:

    # "As the door 'clicked' I turned the lock and gently pushed the door open."
    "ドアが「カチッ」と音を立てると、私は鍵を回し、そっと押し開けた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1502
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_f6afc786:

    # MARKUS @ talk "... Good enough for me."
    MARKUS @ talk "…まあいいや。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1510
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_c4f7511a:

    # "The two of us froze."
    "私たち二人は固まった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1511
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_9e5027ce:

    # "As the door swung open, we were met with a vision from a nightmare."
    "扉が開いた瞬間、私たちの目の前に広がったのは悪夢のような光景だった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1512
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_01b83f04:

    # "The once-grand interior had been reduced to a butcher's slaughterhouse."
    "かつて壮麗だった内部は、肉屋の屠殺場と化していた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1513
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_90b7cdac:

    # "Skinless corpses hung upside down from the ceiling, stripped to bare muscle and bone."
    "剥き出しの死体が天井から逆さに吊るされ、筋と骨だけにまで削ぎ落とされていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1514
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_c4be4c76:

    # "Blood pooled across the marble floor, seeping through the cracks, thick and dark."
    "大理石の床に血の海が広がり、濃く黒く、割れ目に染み渡っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1515
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_41064796:

    # "The walls—once adorned with noble decorations—were now drenched in red, clawed apart by something inhuman."
    "壁は――かつては貴重な装飾が施されていたが――今は赤に染まり、人ならざる者によって引き裂かれたように傷ついていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1517
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_82745b70:

    # "Markus clamped a hand over his mouth, struggling to contain the bile rising in his throat."
    "マルクスは口を手で押さえ、喉までこみ上げてくる吐き気を必死にこらえた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1518
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_69ce6828:

    # MC @ serious "{i}What... the fuck is this?{/i}"
    MC @ serious "{i}一体なんだ…このくそったれは？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1520
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_29ff1ca2:

    # "At the center of the room, where a dining table might have once stood, a grotesque mound of flesh sat piled high."
    "部屋の中央、かつて食卓が置かれていたかもしれない場所に、異様な肉の塊が山と積み上げられていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1522
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_86287958:

    # "Intestines. Organs. Skin. Dumped in a heap."
    "腸。臓器。皮膚。一塊に投げ捨てられた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1523
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_896249e0:

    # "Flies buzzed in an unholy symphony, circling the monstrous offering."
    "蝿が不気味なシンフォニーを奏でながら、異形の供物の周りを飛び交っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1524
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_0b5a34ed:

    # MARKUS @ scared "What kind of nightmare is this?!"
    MARKUS @ scared "一体どういう悪夢なんだ？!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1525
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_0cb12ff6:

    # "Then, our eyes lifted to the ceiling."
    "それから、私たちの目線は天井へと向かった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1526
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_7e834076:

    # "Dark green, bulbous eggs clung to the rafters, pulsating softly."
    "暗緑色の、膨らんだ卵が垂木にへばりつき、微かに脈打っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1527
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_74ae2451:

    # "Each was the size of a child, their slimy shells shifting as something inside pressed against the walls."
    "それぞれが子供ほどの大きさで、粘液で覆われた殻が、内側で何かが壁を押すように動くたびに、揺れ動いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1530
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_1334cad7:

    # MYU @ scared "H-Home! We go home!"
    MYU @ scared "はっ、家だ!帰ろう!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1531
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_de377bd4:

    # MYU @ scared "Myu no like!"
    MYU @ scared "みゅーのらいく!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1532
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_d47b469c:

    # MC @ serious "Calm yourself, Myu."
    MC @ serious "落ち着いて、ミュ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1536
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_menu_d77bc44c:

    # ELENA @ angry "I don't like this... We should wait for Captain Nyx and the other guards."
    ELENA @ angry "嫌だわ、これ……
キャプテン・ニックスや他の警備隊員を待つべきよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1546
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_149dbee7:

    # MC @ serious "Now... While we have the element of surprise, we can kill them while they sleep."
    MC @ serious "さて... 不意打ちが効く内に、奴らが寝ている間に殺そう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1547
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_32187107:

    # MARKUS @ angry "Now would have been a lovely time for someone here to have some fire magecraft... But I guess our blades will do."
    MARKUS @ angry "今ここに火の魔術を使える者がいれば最高の時だ…  
だが、刀でなんとかするか。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1550
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_0f510ccb:

    # "The others nodded sheepishly, as each of us carefully found one of those wretching pulsing sacks of flesh."
    "他の者たちは申し訳なさそうにうなずき、それぞれが吐き気を催す脈打つ肉塊を注意深く見つけた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1551
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_b7834ded:

    # "Timed just right, each of us destroyed the sacks and killed the wretched, sleeping creatures inside one by one."
    "タイミングぴったりで、我々はそれぞれ袋を破壊し、中にいる醜い眠りこけた生物を一匹ずつ殺していった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1552
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_67f47e67:

    # "One tried to scream, awakening at just the right moment, but as the blade sliced across it's throat only a gargled bloody choke escape it's lips."
    "目覚めた瞬間、彼は叫ぼうとしたが、刃が喉を切り裂くやいなや、唇から零れたのは血混じりの、咽びつくような息だけだった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1553
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_63d21d99:

    # "As we worked through in our silent slaughter, a voice suddenly boomed."
    "静寂なる殺戮を進める中、突然、声が轟いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1554
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_282795e0:

    # POLTRIK "{i}Murderers...{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}殺人者たち…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1556
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_2f70fbff:

    # "We stopped in our bloody work to look around."
    "我々は血まみれの仕事を中断し、辺りを見回した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1558
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_8fac6bff:

    # POLTRIK "{i}You think this has aided your cause?{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}これがあなたの目的に役立つと思うか？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1559
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_5c8f4641:

    # POLTRIK "{i}We are inevitable.{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}我々は必然である。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1560
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_snuckin_9f87f1dc:

    # POLTRIK "{i}God has shown us the way!{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}神は我らに道を示されたぞ!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1565
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_5c7b731b:

    # POLTRIK "{i}...You should have left us alone.{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}は…俺たちを放っておくべきだった{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1566
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_6027bd03:

    # "Hand on my sword hilt, I scanned the shadows."
    "柄に手をかけ、影を見据える。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1567
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_a3c6d5de:

    # MC @ angry "Who are you, really?!"
    MC @ angry "お前は、本当は誰だ？!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1568
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_e8fe007d:

    # MC @ angry "SHOW YOURSELF!"
    MC @ angry "姿を見せろ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1569
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_caa25fad:

    # "My voice echoed through the desecrated halls."
    "私の声が、冒涜された回廊に響き渡った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1570
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_9b8aa620:

    # "From somewhere unseen, a voice answered back—twisted, broken."
    "見えないどこかから、歪んだ、壊れた声が応えた——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1571
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_07d4c83f:

    # POLTRIK "{i}...Who are we?{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}…私たちは誰？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1572
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_30e546ed:

    # POLTRIK "{i}We are beings who just want to belong...{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}私たちは、ただ...属していたいだけの存在なのです{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1573
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_6d0f612f:

    # POLTRIK "{i}God made us so cold... so very cold...{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}神様は私たちをあまりにも冷たく…あまりにも虚ろに造った…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1577
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_c1dce48c:

    # ELENA @ shock "We must leave—NOW!"
    ELENA @ shock "逃げる―今すぐに!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1580
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_ea70dec5:

    # POLTRIK "{i}BUT THEN...{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}しかしその時…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1581
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_0ed59f13:

    # POLTRIK "{i}He showed us a way. A way to be warm.{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}彼は私たちに道を示した。温もりを得る道を。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1582
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_50b1a83f:

    # POLTRIK "{i}A way we could all feel like we belonged...{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}私たちみんなが居場所があると感じられるようになる方法ができたら…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1583
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_c1f9da7c:

    # "From the rafters above, something dripped."
    "上の梁から、何かがしたたった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1584
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_0c4d28ae:

    # "A shadow shifted."
    "影が動いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1585
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_4bf5f448:

    # "And then—the bones cracked."
    "そして――骨が軋んだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1586
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_51badad6:

    # "A ghoulish, twisted figure peeled itself from the ceiling—limbs bending unnaturally as it hung upside down."
    "化け物のようなねじれた姿が天井から剥がれ落ちた――異様に歪んだ四肢が、逆さまにぶら下がりながら。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1587
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_81a4378c:

    # "The milky eyes locked onto me."
    "白濁した瞳が私を見据えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1588
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_362be17f:

    # "Then, from the hallways."
    "そして、廊下の方から。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1589
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_dc4eeccb:

    # "From the walls."
    "壁から。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1590
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_c0f06459:

    # "From every godsforsaken corner of this house."
    "この家のありとあらゆる見放された片隅から。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1591
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_5bb923a1:

    # "More of them began to emerge."
    "さらに多くのものが現れ始めた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1593
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_251de4c9:

    # MARKUS @ scared "They're surrounding us!"
    MARKUS @ scared "奴らが包囲してきた!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1594
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_909cc502:

    # "Dozens of inhuman shapes lurched forward—clawed hands dragging across the blood-soaked floors."
    "無数の非人の姿が前へとよろめく――爪先を引きずりながら、血塗られた床を這うように。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1595
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_bbd6f8f0:

    # POLTRIK "{i}...We just feel so very at home in your skin...{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}……この肌の中は、本当に居心地がいい……{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1598
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_1a081b46:

    # "Then, the first of them lunged."
    "そして、最初の一匹が襲い掛かった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1605
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_kickedopen_7f195851:

    # "One by one, the wretched things fell."
    "一つまた一つ、惨めなものたちが倒れていった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1614
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_poltrik_battle_b7f4738f:

    # POLTRIK "{i}You could have spent your final hours with your loved ones...{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}最期の時間を愛する人と過ごせたはずなのに…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:1615
translate ja qst_thecomingstorm_poltrik_family_estate_poltrik_battle_bbfa5b83:

    # POLTRIK "{i}Yet you persist. You resist the inevitable...{/i}"
    POLTRIK "{i}それでも貴方は抗い続ける。抗うべき運命に…{/i}"

